      "title": "How this GLP-1 app generated 20m+ views",
      "preview_text": "An app spent $21,418, generated 23.1M views and scaled from $2k -> $25k mrr within 4 months on Content Rewards.\nit's a GLP-1 tracking app, and they've been running one campaign since April.\nthe",
