      "content": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "28k9q",
            "text": "An app spent $21,418, generated 23.1M views and scaled from $2k -> $25k mrr within 4 months on Content Rewards.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5ev86",
            "text": "it's a GLP-1 tracking app, and they've been running one campaign since April.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4gcla",
            "text": "the content is faceless AI slideshows posted on tiktok, and they are running with an effective CPM of $0.91",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3e49l",
            "text": "here's exactly how the whole campaign worked",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 0,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2ded3",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "a25r2",
            "text": "why GLP-1 apps can't run ads",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "b9b5u",
            "text": "running ads is already a stupid option on its own, due to the crazy high cpms and low af conversion rates",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5jnia",
            "text": "but GLP-1 apps are restricted from running them in the first place",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "fgk99",
            "text": "On Meta, they have a policy for weight loss ads, they must target 18 or over, you can't make claims about physical appearance and you're banned from running certain formats",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 1,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "eijh8",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "et8c4",
            "text": "and here's another policy from Meta",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4vr8e",
            "text": "\"For weight loss products that require prescription, please refer to Drugs and Pharmaceuticals ads policy and comply with the geo-targeting, and written permission requirements.\"",
            "type": "blockquote"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "eugot",
            "text": "you need written permission from Meta before you run anything",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6emal",
            "text": "which is why organic is the best method for apps like this",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "aih54",
            "text": "organic content doesn't have to go thru ad review and there's no team deciding what creative should stay up and what shouldn't. a creator can post a slideshow about their experience and the algo will push it like all other content",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "60s8o",
            "text": "so for GLP-1 apps organic is the way to go",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 2,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "10csl",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6acm",
            "text": "the campaign",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "78req",
            "text": "the campaign was really simple",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "afs61",
            "text": "it was TikTok only, and the content was AI slideshows",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7bpee",
            "text": "so completely faceless, all images & slides generated by AI",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "da9re",
            "text": "this is really important, because weight loss is personal. 99% of creators won't show their face on a slideshow for a GLP-1 app which is exactly why they used AI slideshows.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7kn78",
            "text": "the rates were:",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7siuf",
            "text": "$1 RPM, $400 cap per video and an MVR of 1000",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 3,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5sccs",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "avtru",
            "text": "and they require a 40% tier 1 audience for each account, because tier 1 countries means higher conversion rates & more people that can actually pay",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 4,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5rdih",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "1hgpn",
            "text": "the content vault",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "evd4a",
            "text": "a lot of app founders mess up here",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "34tc5",
            "text": "don't be like them",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "2othh",
            "text": "see, most founders just write a brief that says \"make videos about our app\" and they get a lot submissions that don't convert or generate views at all",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 29,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "6b598",
            "text": "this campaign didn't do that.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4puvq",
            "text": "for this campaign they gave creators a full tutorial on how to create slideshows w Gemini, a content vault full of viral slideshow formats & structures and they even did live calls",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 5,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9o765",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "c9jkk",
            "text": "for new creators this was a gamechanger",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6jicl",
            "text": "everyone knew exactly what they had to do",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 53,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "8a711",
            "text": "and that's why 139 creators produced 2945 submissions",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 6,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6h8mg",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5k8f9",
            "text": "if they ran a campaign where creators had to invent their own formats, they wouldn't have got anywhere near these results",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 40,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "9el9h",
            "text": "the brief & content vault was so crucial",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9o22v",
            "text": "they had 139 creators all using the same prompt bank, everyone was generating consistent and viral content.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 7,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ao8ls",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6g67g",
            "text": "where the views came from",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ajtlg",
            "text": "139 creators submitted to this campaign.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6fbk8",
            "text": "but 10 of them generated 21M out of the 23.1M views",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "compp",
            "text": "two creators did 11.8M and the top creator posted 324 times for 6.2M views.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "b5454",
            "text": "only 60 out of the 139 who submitted had at least one post approved",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "h20u",
            "text": "this is something you need to consider when you launch your campaign",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 47,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "1vusa",
            "text": "you aren't trying to find thousands of creators",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "crqi8",
            "text": "you're looking to find a few very dedicated ones who will post on multiple accounts daily and stay consistent for months",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "d0ejf",
            "text": "the top 2 alone in this campaign earned $5000+ each because they were consistent",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 8,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "42hba",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6cfd4",
            "text": "how they funded it",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5oraq",
            "text": "they didn't deposit $30K in one go",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4fdtr",
            "text": "for the first run they started with $4k, and they topped up five times over four months",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "q532",
            "text": "they topped up $3000 in May, $5000 in June and $2500 a few weeks after that. Then they added another $5000 on July 1st and finally $10,000 at the end of July (their biggest topup so far)",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 9,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "dcrse",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "ciph2",
            "text": "this was a really smart thing to do, they tested with different amounts and once they knew it was working they went much bigger",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "47e0s",
            "text": "a lot of brands start with one huge budget, which works & can still generate results",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "d85d7",
            "text": "but at the start you could lose money due to creators using formats that don't actually convert etc",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 10,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8rf8r",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "18man",
            "text": "the numbers so far",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8mdhl",
            "text": "as of today the campaign has done 23.1M views with a spend of $21,418",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7mv7q",
            "text": "and the app has gone from $2k mrr all the way to $25k mrr and generated $100k in revenue within a few months",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "fq00j",
            "text": "all with an effective CPM of $0.91",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5rsl5",
            "text": "and the campaign is still running, there's $8000+ left in the budget and a huge volume of submissions are still coming in daily",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4881v",
            "text": "Meta would charge $8-14 and still restrict you heavily in this niche",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "9v05u",
            "text": "this is why organic always wins",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4i4qr",
            "text": "the results speak for themselves",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "brpim",
            "text": "if you want to generate results as good as these, book a call and we'll help you setup your first campaign:",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 11,
                "length": 11,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 11,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "cv3hg",
            "text": "Book a call",
            "type": "unstyled"
          }
        ],
